---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---
<Layout title="Privacy" description="Morningwit keeps your puzzle progress in your own browser. This page says exactly what is stored and what is not." noindex>
	<div class="wrap-narrow prose">
		<h1>Privacy</h1>
		<p><em>Last updated September 29, 2026.</em></p>

		<h2>What stays in your browser</h2>
		<p>
			To remember your boards, timer preference, colour theme, streaks and the last valid word box you typed, Morningwit uses your browser's local storage. That data lives on your device.
			It is not sent to us. Clearing site data in your browser removes it.
		</p>

		<h2>What we collect</h2>
		<p>
			We do not ask for an account, a name or an email address to play. We do not run advertising or ad tracking on this site.
			Like any website, our host may keep standard server logs, such as request time and IP address, for security and to keep the site running.
		</p>

		<h2>Cookies</h2>
		<p>Morningwit does not set cookies of its own.</p>

		<h2>Changes</h2>
		<p>If this changes, for example if ads or analytics are added later, this page will be updated first and will say so plainly.</p>

		<h2>Questions</h2>
		<p>Write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
